            "width": 736,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Plan-gated\n\nTentative projects are a legacy feature: both the Free site appmixer2.eu and the 14-day trial site appmixer3.eu answer 422 \"You have reached the limit of 0 tentative projects on your price plan\" (2026-10-14). Current plans list tentative resource planning only under Optimize/Enterprise, so ConfirmProject cannot be exercised on a test site — expected failure, not a flow problem."
